From 71fd9738661de0c5842ddf9072bca6cd80de3e23 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] misc: mediatek: integrate vendor modem ports and tty
 lifecycle
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adapt vendor modem ports and ttyCCCI0 lifecycle to the MT6897 source
layout while retaining the legacy char-port interface.

